1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,699
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:24,420
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

3
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,240
This world is a riot of color

4
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:30,240
Truth and lies fool our eyes

5
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:33,240
Look carefully with your heart

6
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:36,240
Find the truth in the ancestral courtyard

7
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:39,240
Hey you, good or bad, truth or lies

8
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:42,240
Can't escape the gray smoke in your heart

9
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:45,240
Bring all your courage

10
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:48,240
Maybe you can save this world

11
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:51,240
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

12
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:54,240
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,240
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

14
00:00:57,240 --> 00:01:16,200
In the last episode, Jingjing, the angel above the clouds

15
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,200
fell to the human world because of a failed spell

16
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,200
And the forgetful student Locky, by a lucky chance

17
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,200
became Jingjing's savior

18
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,200
The truant boy

19
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,919
Locky

20
00:01:39,919 --> 00:01:42,560
You're the king of being late!

21
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:45,739
I'm not late today!

22
00:01:45,739 --> 00:01:48,379
There are thirty-one days in a month

23
00:01:48,379 --> 00:01:49,939
You were on time only one day

24
00:01:49,939 --> 00:01:52,099
Tell me, what have you got to be proud of?

25
00:01:52,099 --> 00:01:55,679
What are you laughing at?

26
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,880
Is it that funny?

27
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,140
Come in.

28
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:06,020
This is our new classmate, Jingjing.

29
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:08,340
She just transferred here from another town.

30
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:11,000
From now on, everyone should take good care of her.

31
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,480
Hello everyone.

32
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,439
Jingjing.

33
00:02:13,439 --> 00:02:15,520
Please take your seat and get ready for class.

34
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,020
Okay.

35
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,320
We'll have a pop quiz now.

36
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:29,160
What's that "huh" for?

37
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,939
You must learn and practice.

38
00:02:31,939 --> 00:02:33,020
Absolutely no.

39
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:33,820
Slacking off.

40
00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:36,160
Jingjing.

41
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,400
If you can't do it, that's okay.

42
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,080
I'll give you extra lessons.

43
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,080
Thank you, teacher.

44
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:41,920
Jingjing's not scared.

45
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:44,240
No talking.

46
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,960
No looking around.

47
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,960
Okay.

48
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,960
Knowledge Elf.

49
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,960
I need your help.

50
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,960
Leave it to me.

51
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,960
Time's up.

52
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,960
Hand in your papers.

53
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,960
Exam's over?

54
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:24,600
Today's lesson is dissecting a goldfish.

55
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,760
No looking around.

56
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,800
Begin dissecting.

57
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:32,540
Poor thing...

58
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,319
Now the little goldfish can go back to living in the water.

59
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:52,239
No talking.

60
00:03:52,239 --> 00:03:53,439
No looking around.

61
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:56,419
Locky!

62
00:03:56,419 --> 00:03:58,719
You actually put the goldfish back in the tank?

63
00:03:58,719 --> 00:04:00,599
Are you trying to wreck my lesson plan?

64
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:02,759
Why is it always you causing trouble in class?

65
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:04,219
You're done for today.

66
00:04:04,219 --> 00:04:09,259
Come with me to the office.

67
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:15,300
Locky.

68
00:04:15,300 --> 00:04:17,460
You've been getting more and more out of line lately.

69
00:04:17,460 --> 00:04:20,220
Not only do you show up late...

70
00:04:20,220 --> 00:04:22,180
Now you're disrupting class again.

71
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,580
About this morning's exam—

72
00:04:23,580 --> 00:04:24,759
I haven't even gotten to you yet.

73
00:04:24,759 --> 00:04:26,300
And now you're at it again.

74
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:28,800
It's not like it's my first time failing.

75
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,780
What are you muttering about?

76
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:32,080
You cheated, and you still think you're right?

77
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,160
I didn't cheat.

78
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,240
Then explain this.

79
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,360
All correct!

80
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,560
From the day you started school,

81
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,759
when have you ever passed an exam?

82
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:42,039
I don't know what happened.

83
00:04:42,039 --> 00:04:43,599
I fell asleep during the exam.

84
00:04:43,599 --> 00:04:44,459
I didn't cheat.

85
00:04:44,459 --> 00:04:46,180
Looks like you've not only learned to cheat,

86
00:04:46,180 --> 00:04:47,199
but also learned to lie.

87
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:49,079
Late to school,

88
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,120
cheating on exams,

89
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,459
disrupting class,

90
00:04:51,459 --> 00:04:52,740
and lying on top of that.

91
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:56,480
I've never seen such a terrible kid as you.

92
00:04:56,480 --> 00:05:00,180
Have your parents come to school tomorrow.

93
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:03,779
Locky!

94
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:21,020
Class missile!

95
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:21,760
Late and cheating!

96
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:22,480
No shame!

97
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:27,420
Locky, look!

98
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:29,320
This gem is so beautiful!

99
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,380
Who exactly are you?

100
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:32,600
What's with that fish tank?

101
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,420
What exactly are you following me for?

102
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:37,839
I'm an angel!

103
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:39,040
Locky saved me.

104
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,699
I'm here to repay him!

105
00:05:40,699 --> 00:05:42,639
Curly, don't give me that!

106
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:45,600
I really am an angel.

107
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,620
Remember the black rabbit that scared you off this morning?

108
00:05:48,620 --> 00:05:50,920
I'll make it appear again so you can see.

109
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:57,139
Okay!

110
00:05:57,139 --> 00:06:00,340
Little black rabbit, little black rabbit!

111
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:02,920
Curly, stop messing around.

112
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,420
Hurry home and do your homework.

113
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,300
I really am an angel.

114
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:08,699
Maybe I've been away from the sky too long,

115
00:06:08,699 --> 00:06:10,080
so my powers have grown weak.

116
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:12,720
I'm the one who filled in your exam paper for you!

117
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:15,439
So it was you! Why are you trying to ruin me?

118
00:06:15,439 --> 00:06:18,640
Because I'm an angel repaying a kindness!

119
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:22,340
Jingjing could tell at a glance that Locky is a dimwit,

120
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:23,240
bad at studying,

121
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,220
a kid hated by teachers and classmates.

122
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,000
So I wanted to help you get good grades,

123
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,759
so everyone would like you!

124
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:31,800
Angel repaying a kindness? Teachers and classmates?

125
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:35,180
Anyway, I'm just a dim-witted, bad-at-studying, always-late, good-for-nothing guy.

126
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:36,920
You all hate me.

127
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:38,660
I hate you all too.

128
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:40,800
Don't any of you boss me around!

129
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:43,480
I'm never going to school again!

130
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:06,680
Little girl, who are you?

131
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,379
I'm Jingjing.

132
00:07:08,379 --> 00:07:10,460
I'm here to find Locky.

133
00:07:10,460 --> 00:07:13,439
You're his classmate, right?

134
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:17,379
First time a classmate's come to see Locky.

135
00:07:17,379 --> 00:07:19,639
Doesn't Locky have any friends?

136
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:22,000
Yeah, that kid's got a bad temper.

137
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,080
Very few people are willing to play with him.

138
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,920
Oh, I forgot to introduce myself.

139
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:28,280
I'm Locky's uncle, Jimmy Chen.

140
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:28,800
Come in.

141
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:32,300
Hello, Uncle.

142
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:39,720
That kid's probably upstairs.

143
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,860
I'll go get him down.

144
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,139
Stay here tonight.

145
00:07:42,139 --> 00:07:43,699
And have dinner with us.

146
00:07:43,699 --> 00:07:47,180
Locky!

147
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:49,360
Locky!

148
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:51,300
Locky!

149
00:07:51,300 --> 00:07:53,980
Your friend came to play with you!

150
00:07:53,980 --> 00:07:55,120
You...

151
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,960
Sleeping so early?

152
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,500
Afraid you'll be late tomorrow?

153
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,939
He's really asleep.

154
00:08:00,939 --> 00:08:02,160
Uncle...

155
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,980
Everyone hates me.

156
00:08:04,980 --> 00:08:07,279
I don't want to go to school anymore.

157
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:11,139
Locky...

158
00:08:11,139 --> 00:08:12,639
A real man facing problems

159
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,779
should never back down.

160
00:08:14,779 --> 00:08:16,339
But I really don't want to go to school.

161
00:08:16,339 --> 00:08:18,899
Then what do you want to do?

162
00:08:18,899 --> 00:08:22,800
I want to be like you, Uncle—

163
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,019
a mighty and impressive

164
00:08:24,019 --> 00:08:25,339
great detective!

165
00:08:25,339 --> 00:08:26,759
No, no.

166
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:30,639
A cartoon hero skipping school would be a bad influence on the kids!

167
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:33,039
I don't care! I don't care! I don't care!

168
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,220
I just want to be a detective!

169
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:36,159
I'm never going back to school!

170
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:39,460
Why don't we go eat first?

171
00:08:39,460 --> 00:08:41,080
No! No! No! No!

172
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,000
If you won't let me be a detective,

173
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,779
then I won't eat!

174
00:08:43,779 --> 00:08:49,899
Uncle,

175
00:08:49,899 --> 00:08:52,580
you said I could be a detective—so keep your word!

176
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:56,259
But your studies really can't be delayed.

177
00:08:56,259 --> 00:08:59,740
Just so happens, I'm free tomorrow.

178
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:02,019
I can go talk to the teacher first.

179
00:09:02,019 --> 00:09:04,519
No, the teacher doesn't believe me at all.

180
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,679
I don't want to go to school.

181
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:07,659
I want to be a detective with Uncle!

182
00:09:07,659 --> 00:09:11,779
I hate annoying problems like "A plus B, all squared."

183
00:09:11,779 --> 00:09:14,299
I want to be a detective with Uncle!

184
00:09:14,299 --> 00:09:18,600
Hello? It's me.

185
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:24,399
Locky, there's an urgent case. I have to go.

186
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:25,419
Uncle, I'm going too.

187
00:09:25,419 --> 00:09:25,860
No.

188
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:28,179
Uncle, you're cheating.

189
00:09:28,179 --> 00:09:30,419
You promised I could be a detective.

190
00:09:30,419 --> 00:09:31,740
Sorry, Locky.

191
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:34,319
It's urgent. I have to go.

192
00:09:34,319 --> 00:09:41,319
Uncle, you big liar!

193
00:09:41,319 --> 00:09:45,399
The rare treasure Angel's Tear will be exhibited at the city museum.

194
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:46,599
A rare opportunity.

195
00:09:46,599 --> 00:09:50,399
Locky, let's go to the museum to see Angel's Tear together.

196
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:52,659
Let's go, let's go, let's go!

197
00:09:52,659 --> 00:09:54,259
Curly, go home now.

198
00:09:54,259 --> 00:09:55,519
Stop bothering me.

199
00:10:24,259 --> 00:10:28,259
[Ending Theme]

200
00:10:28,259 --> 00:10:32,259
Every day is just sunrise and sunset.

201
00:10:32,259 --> 00:10:36,259
Step into a world and dream more

202
00:10:36,259 --> 00:10:42,259
Long for every second, every moment of life

203
00:10:42,259 --> 00:10:47,259
My bright eyes sparkle

204
00:10:47,259 --> 00:10:51,259
A smile that greets the sun

205
00:10:51,259 --> 00:10:56,899
Soft steps at the crossing by Qian'an's home